=== nfsslower-bpfcc ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Trace READ, WRITE, OPEN, GETATTR and COMMIT NFS calls slower than a
threshold,supports NFSv{3,4}


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  nfsslower-bpfcc [-h] [-j] [-p PID] [min_ms]


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  min_ms  Minimum IO duration to trace in ms (default=10ms)


FLAGS (3) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-h, --help     show this help message and exit
-j, --csv      just print fields: comma-separated values
-p, --pid PID  Trace this pid only
